Description: The MaMaMIA provides a workflow for rough and rapid interspecific introgression detection in Genotyping-by-Sequencing (GBS) mapping data. It integrates GC-bias correction, pairwise chromosome comparison, and coverage depth profile segmentation to identify introgressed segments.
